{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Despite his social anxiety, Mr White is a rather excellent detective. One day, he is commissioned to find a missing maths professor, a eublepharis named Mr Sturt. However, there\u2019s a hitch - among other evidence various parts of the professor's body are found, perfectly intact and not in a hurry to return to their riginal places... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr. White\u2019s Agency is a detective story with a rich narrative and well-developed characters. It\u2019s a warm and charming adventure, with not a single murder throughout the entire story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- In a location, the player solves puzzles to find witnesses and evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The player can use clues they find to ask more questions from the witnesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/GD1.gif?t=1739524037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The most valuable pieces of information go into the journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/GD3.gif?t=1739524037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- When the players decide that they\u2019re ready, they can choose to answer the questions of the customer and all the witnesses with the help of the diary, and see whether they were right.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403850?t=1739524037","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403850?t=1739524037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/04c220a374b54b8bdba46bf8051fdb5cffc32a55/capsule_